tool.consolidate_notes.rubric:
What to do (only if needed):
- merge obvious duplicates: note_merge(ids[], content);
- rewrite the outdated (note_revise — a small edit) or supersede it (note_supersede — a meaningful rework, keeps a «scar»);
- link related notes: note_link (supports/contradicts/refines/relates).
Change only what is truly needed; if everything is fine — call nothing.
